<Base title="About" description="About The Twice Born, by Amitabh Manu.">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <!-- Draft for the author to revise. -->
    <p><em>The Twice Born</em> is an illustrated adventure by Amitabh Manu, told in five books:
      <em>Valley</em>, <em>Parchment</em>, <em>Leaf</em>, <em>Ascent</em> and <em>Discovery</em>.
      It began as a novel and was adapted, chapter by chapter, into this comic.</p>
    <p>The art follows the tradition of mid-century Indian adventure comics: clean ink lines, flat warm colour and expressive faces.</p>
    <h2>Reading on this site</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Arrow keys</strong> or swipes turn pages; tap the left or right third of a page to go back or forward.</li>
      <li><strong>Panels</strong> mode steps through a page one panel at a time, which is best on a phone.</li>
      <li><strong>Text</strong> shows the page's captions and dialogue as plain text.</li>
      <li>Your place is remembered in this browser, so you can continue where you left off.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
